[b]Sticky Struggles keeps on getting better! We've listened to your feedback and put it into practice in this latest version.[/b]

- We understand that accessibility is paramount, and we're committed to fostering an inclusive gaming environment where every player can participate fully and enjoyably. Colour blind Mode has been added to Sticky Struggles — Users can now customise their experience by selecting from three colour vision deficiency modes: Protanopia, Deuteranopia, and Tritanopia!
- Expanded language support to include Spanish (ES) and Basque languages;
- If Steam client is set to Spanish, the game will automatically launch in Spanish upon initial start-up.
- Replaced Twitter icon;
- Tweaked the placement of UI elements on language selection screens;
- Updated list of translators;
- Level 1 now provides clearer indications of which block the player controls (only if Level 1 has not previously been completed).

If you experience any issues or want to give feedback, [url=https://pactiongames.com/#contact]please reach out to us.[/url]

[b]Sticky Struggles keeps on getting better! We've listened to your feedback and put it into practice in this latest version.[/b]

- Fixed minor frame rate issues;
- Fixed an issue where elements on level selection screen were obscured by gradient masking towards the lower section of the screen on aspect ratios wider than 21:9;
- Minor optimisations and improvements.

If you experience any issues or want to give feedback, [url=https://pactiongames.com/#contact]please reach out to us.[/url]

